[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658296265","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3552#issuecomment-3658296265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3552","id":3658296265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7aDSvJ","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-16T01:22:18Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T01:24:50Z","body":"@rahulvils Can you provide a stackblitz or CSB reproducing this?\n\nPossibly your `<form>` element is missing `noValidate`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658296265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658335818","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3552#issuecomment-3658335818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3552","id":3658335818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7aDcZK","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-16T01:40:03Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T01:52:07Z","body":"`<form noValidate>` (as @mj12albert mentioned) will block native validation if it's not necessary here\n\nIf validation is warranted, the issue shown in the popup is that there's a `stepMismatch` error. The `step` property defaults to `1` so if the input value doesn't match it will trigger a validation error. `format={{ maximumFractionDigits: 0 }}` makes the input value match the default step. Since you've specified `step={0.01}`, you want fractional values, so `format={{ maximumFractionDigits: 2 }}` will make the input display `0.43` instead of `0.433333....` and pass the validation successfully.\n\nAlso, if you do want native validation, add `contain: layout` CSS around on the `<NumberField.Root>` component so the native popup roughly points to the correct area since it's trying to point to the fixed hidden input in the top-left\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658335818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658539506","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3552#issuecomment-3658539506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3552","id":3658539506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7aEOHy","user":{"login":"rahulvils","id":198028272,"node_id":"U_kgDOC82r8A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198028272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils","html_url":"https://github.com/rahulvils","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahulvils/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-16T03:12:29Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T03:12:29Z","body":"The config ```format={{ maximumFractionDigits: 2 }}``` and the ```noValidate``` fixed the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658539506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3658543633","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3552#issuecomment-3658543633","issue_url":"https:/